## 2. Native Charts Engine (Phase 6)

@chart spline title="Quarterly API Traffic & Revenue" theme="dark"
labels:
  Q1
  Q2
  Q3
  Q4

data:
  120
  180
  240
  310
@/chart

---

## 3. Native Diagram Engine (Phase 5)

@diagram sequence title="Authentication Sequence"
actor User
actor App
actor Server

User -> App: Enter credentials
App -> Server: POST /login
Server -> App: Bearer Token
App -> User: Authenticated
@/diagram

---

## 4. Native Math Engine (Phase 4)

Inline math: $E = mc^2$ and Euler's identity $e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0$.

@math label="eq:einstein"
E = \frac{m_0 c^2}{\sqrt{1 - \frac{v^2}{c^2}}}
@/math

Reference to Equation @ref(eq:einstein).

---

## 5. Native Block Directives (Phase 3)

@tabs
  @tab label="Overview"
    @card title="System Status" variant="success"
      All services operational across global regions.
    @/card
  @/tab
  @tab label="Progress"
    @progress value=85 @/progress
  @/tab
@/tabs

---

## 6. Callouts & Admonitions (Phases 2-3)

> [!TIP]
> Zolto is a high-performance document engine supporting native math, diagrams, charts, vectors, and directives.

[info title="Zolto Engine Info"]
100% backward compatible with CommonMark and GitHub Flavored Markdown.
[/info]

