## 7. Definition List & Code Metadata

```javascript title="app.js" {2} numbers
import { compile } from 'zolto';
const html = compile(zoltoSourceStr);
console.log(html);
```

Vector Engine
: Declarative `@vector` block syntax compiling into responsive, accessible SVG.

Chart Engine
: Native `@chart <type> ... @/chart` data visualization block.
